	<ouc:properties label="metadata">
		<title>Career &amp; Technical Education | Lake Tahoe Community College</title>
		<meta name="Description" content="Discover Lake Tahoe Community College’s Career and Technical Education (CTE) programs—designed to prepare students for high-wage, high-demand careers. Led by expert educators and supported by industry professionals, LTCC’s cutting-edge programs equip students with technical, academic, and employability skills needed to thrive in today’s workforce. Explore pathways to success with industry-aligned education and real-world experience. Start your career journey today!" />
	</ouc:properties>
	
